        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will it feel like what I'm used to?",
            "a": "Partly. The menthol cores give a real <strong>cool throat hit</strong> on the inhale — the physical sensation is there. What's not there is the <span class=\"redact\">nicotine</span> kick. Think of it as the feeling without the substance."
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Is this a <span class=\"redact\">vape</span>?",
            "a": "No. A <strong>wooden aromatherapy diffuser.</strong> No battery, no coil, no liquid, no heating element. You breathe ordinary air through a wooden mouthpiece — the plant-oil core at the end gives it flavor and a cool menthol sensation."
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will this change my habit for me?",
            "a": "Honest answer: <strong>willpower isn't included in the box.</strong> Lio handles the hand-to-mouth, the deep breath, the pause — the behavioral half nothing else covers. You still bring the decision. Together, it gets much easier."
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "€39 — is it worth it?",
            "a": "Less than a month of packs. The wooden body is <strong>yours to keep forever</strong> — only the cores refill (~€12/month). Most people break even inside three weeks."
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What if it doesn't work for me?",
            "a": "Try it for <strong>30 days</strong>. Use it the way it's meant to be used — every time you'd reach for your old habit. If the ritual doesn't land, <strong>full refund, used or not.</strong>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How long does one core last?",
            "a": "Around <strong>7–10 days for a light user, 3–5 days if you use it heavily.</strong> The wooden body stays with you; only the core changes."
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What's actually in the cores?",
            "a": "Medical-grade polyester fiber infused with <strong>food-safe plant essential oils</strong> — peppermint, cinnamon, mango, orange, depending on the variant. Third-party tested, every batch."
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I use it on a plane or at work?",
            "a": "Yes. No smoke, no vapor, no smell, no electronics. Customers use it on flights, in offices, cinemas, in bed next to their kids."
          }
        },
        "q9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How fast does it arrive?",
            "a": "Shipped from the Netherlands. <strong>2–3 working days across Europe, 4–8 days outside.</strong> Free worldwide, no minimum. Tracking link by email."
          }
        },
        "q10": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "q": "I've never smoked. Can I still use Lio?",
            "a": "Absolutely. Many customers use Lio just for the ritual — a mindful pause during work, a calming breath before bed. <strong>No ex-smoker card required.</strong>"
          }
        }
